{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-casimir-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:q-casimir-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the $q$-Casimir element","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-casimir"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-q-casimir-exists"],"tags":["existence","casimir","quantum-group","central-element"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QCasimir.not_exists_unconstrained","text":"q-casimir-exists.md","leanSource":"q-casimir-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:q-casimir-exists\"></a><p>For any ground ring <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code> in which <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(q - q^{-1})</code> is invertible, the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Casimir element</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  C_q \\;=\\; F E + \\frac{q  K + q^{-1} K^{-1} - (q + q^{-1})}{(q - q^{-1})^2}</code></pre>\n<p>exists as a central element of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{U}_q(\\mathfrak{su}(2))</code> and acts as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[j]_q [j+1]_q  \\mathrm{id}</code> on every simple module <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_j</code>.</p>\n<p>The existence of the Casimir element is standard quantum-group theory.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/q-casimir-exists.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"7.9.5","page":"b/prop-q-casimir-exists","qa":{"counts":{"pass":93,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.QCasimir.not_exists_unconstrained","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/q-casimir-exists.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
